      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Calvary%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Settlers began building houses at the base of the hill in Mount Calvary starting in 1846.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Calvary%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A parish was established in Mount Calvary on February 2, 1849, with church construction beginning the very next day.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Calvary%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A railroad was established in the 1850s and 1860s, connecting Sheboygan to Fond du Lac.",
